  "notes": [
    "Two complete independent fresh-library/WebView runs before and after. Both versions use the same 1440x900 home viewport, 1428x888 map work area and DPR 1; neither uses an outer gutter.",
    "Process-cold does not flush the OS disk cache. Warm runs reuse only their own saved library and WebView profile.",
